==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|direct-current}} {{qualifier|attributive}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}} (abbreviated as [[DC]])

# {{lb|en|physics}} An [[electric current]] in which the [[electron]]s [[flow]] in one [[direction]], but may vary with time.
# {{lb|en|physics}} An [[electric current]] which does not vary with time.
# {{lb|en|physics}} An [[electric circuit]] in which [[voltage]] and [[current]] do not vary with time.

====Sinonyms====
* {{l|en|galvanic current}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|alternating current}}, {{l|en|AC}}

